# Cursor development workflow

This applies to the main Cursor Agent only; subagents follow their task packets. Classify the request: explanations/research need no implementation workflow, trivial changes may be implemented directly, and non-trivial/architectural work must follow [the full existing protocol](../../docs/engineering/CURSOR_ORCHESTRATION.md). Read that protocol before planning such work. Global user instructions, including delegation only on demand, take precedence.

Repository agreements and resource ownership are in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [the engineering guide](../../docs/engineering/PROJECT_GUIDE.md).
